 "description": "Xceedium's GateKeeper is a hardened appliance that functions as a secure centralized management platform that enables IT operations to remotely manage data centers as one integrated system. A standardized security model can be developed to mitigate the risks of \"untrusted\" users; provide centralized access and policy, compartmentalize down to the port, define good and bad behavior, alert and restrict access to applications or commands. GateKeeper provides touch free support and includes all access methods and tools for in-band, out-of-band and power control.",
